# 🧠 Interview Pattern Cheat Sheet

| If Question Says... | Think...                |
| ------------------- | ----------------------- |
| Highest / Lowest    | MAX / MIN               |
| Average             | AVG                     |
| Total               | SUM                     |
| Count               | COUNT                   |
| Per Department      | GROUP BY                |
| Top N               | ROW_NUMBER / DENSE_RANK |
| Starts With         | LIKE 'A%'               |
| Missing Records     | LEFT JOIN + IS NULL     |
| Previous Row        | LAG()                   |
| Next Row            | LEAD()                  |
| Latest Records      | ORDER BY Date DESC      |

